## Original Content
<p>I'm excited to share that Coursera is making a $100 million strategic investment in LearnVector Inc., a newly formed AI-native learning company founded and led by Andrew Ng — one of the world's most influential figures in AI. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/coursera-invests-in-learnvector-to-build-the-future-of-ai-native-learning/">Coursera invests in LearnVector to build the future of AI-native learning</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Coursera is investing $100 million in LearnVector Inc., a newly formed AI-native learning company founded and led by Andrew Ng. This strategic investment aims to advance the development and future of AI-native learning technologies.

## Key Points
- Coursera has made a $100 million strategic investment in LearnVector Inc.
- LearnVector Inc. is a newly formed company focused on AI-native learning.
- The company was founded and is led by Andrew Ng, a prominent figure in AI.
- The investment is intended to build the future of AI-native learning systems.


